"A backup is taken automatically right before BookmarkSync writes to a browser's bookmark file, and before every restore. Backups from the last 7 days are all kept, then one per day up to 30 days (200 at most); manual backups are never removed. Compare a backup with the current bookmarks before restoring it." = "BookmarkSync 每次写入某个浏览器的书签文件之前、每次恢复之前，都会自动备份一次。最近 7 天的备份全部保留，7–30 天每天保留一份（最多 200 份）；手动备份不会被自动删除。恢复前，请先把备份和当前书签对比一下。";
"Compare" = "对比";
"Automatic" = "自动备份";
"Old rotating" = "旧版轮换备份";
"Old daily" = "旧版每日备份";
"Restoring the backup from %@ would make these changes to the current bookmarks:" = "恢复 %@ 的备份，会对当前书签做以下改动：";
"Could not compare: %@" = "无法对比：%@";
"Restore This Backup" = "恢复这份备份";
"Select a backup and click Compare to see what restoring it would change." = "选择一份备份并点击“对比”，查看恢复后会有哪些变化。";
"Quit %@ (⌘Q) before restoring. While it is running it keeps its bookmarks in memory and would overwrite the restored file." = "请先完全退出 %@（⌘Q）再恢复。它运行时书签保存在内存里，会覆盖恢复后的文件。";
"Restored the backup from %@. Bookmarks it lacks will also be removed from your other browsers; a large removal is held in the menu bar for your confirmation first." = "已恢复 %@ 的备份。备份里没有的书签也会从其他浏览器中删除；如果一次删除较多，会先在菜单栏暂停，等你确认。";
"Quit %@ and its web apps (PWAs) completely (⌘Q) to write %ld pending change(s); closing its windows is not enough." = "按 ⌘Q 完全退出 %@ 及其网页应用（PWA）后，才会写入 %ld 项待写入的改动；只关闭窗口不算退出。";
"Could not read this profile's bookmark file. It is skipped, and nothing is deleted, until it can be read again." = "无法读取此配置的书签文件。恢复读取之前会跳过它，不会删除任何书签。";
