"The bookmark will be removed from every synced browser. Each browser's bookmark file is backed up before it is written, and the removed bookmark is kept in the \"Deleted by BookmarkSync\" folder." = "这条书签会从所有已同步的浏览器中移除。写入每个浏览器之前都会先备份书签文件，移除的书签会保留在“Deleted by BookmarkSync”文件夹里。";
